<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Yellow Stripes Collective — Brand Partnerships</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@400;700;900&family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --yellow: #FFD200;
    --charcoal: #1F1F1F;
    --shell: #181818;
    --grey: #5A5A5A;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --card-bg: #242424;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    background: var(--charcoal);
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ── NOISE OVERLAY ── */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1000;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  /* ── NAV ── */
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 20px 48px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(31,31,31,0.95), transparent);
  }

  .nav-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .stripe-icon {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3px;
    transform: skewX(-10deg);
  }

  .stripe-icon span {
    display: block;
    width: 5px;
    background: var(--yellow);
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  .stripe-icon span:nth-child(1) { height: 14px; }
  .stripe-icon span:nth-child(2) { height: 20px; }
  .stripe-icon span:nth-child(3) { height: 26px; }
  .stripe-icon span:nth-child(4) { height: 20px; }

  .nav-wordmark {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .nav-cta {
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--charcoal);
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-cta:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 120px 48px 80px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-bg-stripes {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-bg-stripes::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -20%;
    right: -10%;
    width: 60%;
    height: 140%;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      -55deg,
      transparent,
      transparent 40px,
      rgba(255, 210, 0, 0.03) 40px,
      rgba(255, 210, 0, 0.03) 42px
    );
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--yellow);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease forwards 0.2s;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(64px, 10vw, 130px);
    line-height: 0.92;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease forwards 0.35s;
  }

  .hero-title .accent { color: var(--yellow); }

  .hero-sub {
    max-width: 560px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease forwards 0.5s;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease forwards 0.65s;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--charcoal);
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 16px 40px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); opacity: 0.9; }

  .btn-ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 15px 40px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--yellow); transform: translateY(-2px); }

  .hero-scroll {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 40px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease forwards 0.9s;
  }

  .hero-scroll span {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--grey);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .scroll-line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--yellow), transparent);
    animation: scrollPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  /* ── NUMBERS BAR ── */
  .numbers-bar {
    background: var(--yellow);
    padding: 28px 48px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
  }

  .number-item {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 20px;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(31,31,31,0.2);
  }

  .number-item:last-child { border-right: none; }

  .number-value {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 42px;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .number-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(31,31,31,0.65);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ── SECTION SHARED ── */
  section { padding: 100px 48px; }

  .section-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--yellow);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .section-body {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  /* ── HOW IT WORKS ── */
  .how {
    background: var(--shell);
    position: relative;
  }

  .how-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    position: relative;
  }

  .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .step-number {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 48px;
    color: var(--yellow);
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 52px;
    opacity: 0.35;
  }

  .step-content h3 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .step-content p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  }

  .how-visual {
    position: relative;
    height: 480px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .visual-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,210,0,0.12);
    padding: 32px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 340px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .visual-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--yellow);
  }

  .vc-label {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--yellow);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .vc-amount {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 56px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .vc-sub {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--grey);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .vc-breakdown {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .vc-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .vc-row-label { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }

  .vc-row-val {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .vc-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    margin: 4px 0;
  }

  .vc-total-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,210,0,0.3);
  }

  .vc-total-label {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  .vc-total-val {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  /* ── WHAT YOU GET ── */
  .deliverables {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .deliver-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .deliver-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .deliver-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    padding: 36px 28px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }

  .deliver-card:hover { background: #2c2c2c; }

  .deliver-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0;
    width: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--yellow);
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
  }

  .deliver-card:hover::after { width: 100%; }

  .dc-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .dc-title {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .dc-body {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
  }

  /* ── WHY US ── */
  .why {
    background: var(--shell);
  }

  .why-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .why-points {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .why-point h4 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .why-point h4::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 16px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--yellow);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .why-point p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
  }

  .why-quote {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--yellow);
    padding: 40px 40px;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .why-quote .hl { color: var(--yellow); }

  /* ── PAST BRANDS ── */
  .brands-section {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .brands-label {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--grey);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .brands-track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 48px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .brand-pill {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .brand-pill:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }

  /* ── CTA BLOCK ── */
  .cta-block {
    background: var(--yellow);
    padding: 100px 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-block .section-eyebrow {
    color: rgba(31,31,31,0.6);
  }

  .cta-block .section-title {
    color: var(--charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .cta-block .section-body {
    color: rgba(31,31,31,0.65);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .cta-block .btn-dark {
    background: var(--charcoal);
    color: var(--yellow);
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 18px 48px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-block .btn-dark:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); opacity: 0.9; }

  .cta-contact {
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(31,31,31,0.5);
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer {
    background: #111;
    padding: 40px 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .footer-copy {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--grey);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .footer-stripe {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3px;
    transform: skewX(-10deg);
  }

  .footer-stripe span {
    display: block;
    width: 4px;
    background: rgba(255,210,0,0.3);
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  .footer-stripe span:nth-child(1) { height: 10px; }
  .footer-stripe span:nth-child(2) { height: 15px; }
  .footer-stripe span:nth-child(3) { height: 20px; }
  .footer-stripe span:nth-child(4) { height: 15px; }

  /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @keyframes scrollPulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.3; }
  }

  /* Scroll reveal */
  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(32px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
  }

  .reveal.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .reveal-delay-1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
  .reveal-delay-2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
  .reveal-delay-3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; }
  .reveal-delay-4 { transition-delay: 0.4s; }
  .reveal-delay-5 { transition-delay: 0.5s; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    nav { padding: 20px 24px; }
    section { padding: 72px 24px; }
    .numbers-bar { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }
    .number-item { background: var(--yellow); border-right: none; }
    .how-inner, .why-inner, .deliver-header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
    .deliver-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .why-points { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .how-visual { height: auto; }
    footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo">
    <div class="stripe-icon">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-wordmark">YELLOW STRIPES COLLECTIVE</div>
  </a>
  <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Partner With Us</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg-stripes"></div>
  <div class="hero-eyebrow">Creator-Led. Brand-Ready.</div>
  <h1 class="hero-title">
    One deal.<br><span class="accent">Total</span><br>coverage.
  </h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    Yellow Stripes Collective is a tight-knit roster of tech and gaming creators. You brief us once, we handle everything — from logistics to content delivery.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
    <a href="#how" class="btn-ghost">See How It Works</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-scroll">
    <span>Scroll</span>
    <div class="scroll-line"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- NUMBERS -->
<div class="numbers-bar">
  <div class="number-item">
    <div class="number-value">8+</div>
    <div class="number-label">Creators in Roster</div>
  </div>
  <div class="number-item">
    <div class="number-value">2M+</div>
    <div class="number-label">Combined Reach</div>
  </div>
  <div class="number-item">
    <div class="number-value">1</div>
    <div class="number-label">Point of Contact</div>
  </div>
  <div class="number-item">
    <div class="number-value">0</div>
    <div class="number-label">Headaches for You</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="how" id="how">
  <div class="how-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="section-eyebrow reveal">Process</div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-delay-1">How it<br>actually works</h2>
      <p class="section-body reveal reveal-delay-2">
        No back-and-forth with eight different creators. No chasing invoices. No misaligned briefs. You talk to us once, and we execute.
      </p>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="step-number">01</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Single Brief</h3>
            <p>You send us one brief with your goals, key messages, and timeline. That's it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="step-number">02</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>We Handle Logistics</h3>
            <p>Travel, accommodation, scheduling, content coordination — fully managed by us.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="step-number">03</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Multi-Creator Output</h3>
            <p>Multiple videos, reels, and posts land across the roster's channels simultaneously.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="step-number">04</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>One Invoice</h3>
            <p>A single, clean invoice from Yellow Stripes. Simple, transparent, done.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="how-visual reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <div class="visual-card">
        <div class="vc-label">Sample Partnership Package</div>
        <div class="vc-amount">£14,000</div>
        <div class="vc-sub">Full Event Sponsorship — e.g. CES Las Vegas</div>
        <div class="vc-breakdown">
          <div class="vc-row">
            <span class="vc-row-label">Travel & Accommodation</span>
            <span class="vc-row-val">Included</span>
          </div>
          <div class="vc-divider"></div>
          <div class="vc-row">
            <span class="vc-row-label">Dedicated YouTube Videos</span>
            <span class="vc-row-val">4 Videos</span>
          </div>
